3.5 Invoice Processing Module
File: process_invoice.py

Core business logic for variance analysis and LLM integration.

Key Functions:

Function	Purpose
process_invoice()	Processes all line items with business rules and LLM
process_line_item()	Handles individual line item LLM analysis
Business Rules Applied:

Condition	Action
Invoice Qty < GRN Qty	Skip analysis (favorable variance)
Negative quantities	Skip analysis (data quality issue)
No historical data	Skip LLM, return standard message
Normal case	Perform full LLM analysis
Variance Calculation:

GRN Variance % = |((GRN Qty - Invoice Qty) / GRN Qty)| × 100
