6.2 Parameter Reference
Database & Query Parameters
Parameter	Type	Description
table_name	string	SQL table containing historical GRN data
header_mapping	object	Maps request header fields to DB columns
line_detail_mapping	object	Maps line item fields to DB columns
filter_field_name	array	Fields used in SQL WHERE clause
all_field_to_fetch	array	Fields to SELECT from database
historical_data_duration	int	Days of historical data to consider (default: 730 = 2 years)
Processing Parameters
Parameter	Type	Description
batch_size_for_parellel_processing	int	Max concurrent line items to process
invoice_line_field_name	string	Key containing line items array
invoice_line_id_field_identifier	string	Unique identifier field for line items
invoice_date_field	string	Request field containing invoice date
grn_qty_field_in_line_detail	string	Field containing GRN quantity
Field Mapping Parameters
Parameter	Type	Description
LLM_to_salesforce_key_mapping	object	Maps internal fields to Salesforce field names
LLM_to_History_key_mapping	object	Maps internal fields to historical data fields
common_name_to_table_field	object	Maps common names to database column names
LLM Parameters
Parameter	Type	Description
grn_variance_system_prompt	string	System prompt for Azure OpenAI
grn_variance_user_prompt	string	User prompt template with placeholders
User Prompt Placeholders:

{material_description} - Product description
{invoice_quantity} - Current invoice quantity
{grn_quantity} - Current GRN quantity
{grn_variance} - Calculated variance percentage
{uom} - Unit of measure
{country} - Country code
{invoice_date} - Invoice date
{eda_report} - Statistical analysis JSON
